c-2f673d7806ff","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Vimとは違うな、まあ出自からして仕方ないのかも","ts":"1614652964.081800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yBt3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6afd0044-f647-49ec-a24e-8bec873a4c50","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"まぁこういうことが書かれてるので、そもそもWindowsはEmacsにとって第１級市民じゃないんですよね。。\n\u0026gt; To improve the use of proprietary systems is a misguided goal. Our aim, rather, is to eliminate them. We include support for some proprietary systems in GNU Emacs in the hope that running Emacs on them will give users a taste of freedom and thus lead them to free themselves. \n\u003chttps://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/download.html#nonfree\u003e","ts":"1614652846.081100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PIg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7f63e6b-17e9-445d-bddf-c70d2287d114","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"謎テクヤバそう","ts":"1614652586.080500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y+Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b38e5a2-143c-4838-b199-a419b92d893b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01PA2W76TV/p1614483325075900\u003e\nこれ、謎テクノロジーでパス区切り文字が`\\`ではなく、`/`になっていました。\nということでこの正規表現はちゃんと動きました。","ts":"1614652359.080000","attachments":[{"fallback":"[February 27th, 2021 7:35 PM] conao3: \u003chttps://git.savannah.gnu.org/cgit/emacs.git/commit/?id=4aa9db733730a6780c244fcaf6f51b73fd84777e\u003e\n\u003chttps://debbugs.gnu.org/cgi/bugreport.cgi?bug=46660#20\u003e\nこのパッチ、スラッシュを置くことでファイル名に一致するようにしてるんですが、Windows対応どうなってるんだろう。。","id":1,"author_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","author_name":"Naoya Yamashita","author_subname":"Naoya Yamashita","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/UDPT2BZ6E","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1a9a49807415fb97544a7383a9288b84.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0004-48.png","text":"\u003chttps://git.savannah.gnu.org/cgit/emacs.git/commit/?id=4aa9db733730a6780c244fcaf6f51b73fd84777e\u003e\n\u003chttps://debbugs.gnu.org/cgi/bugreport.cgi?bug=46660#20\u003e\nこのパッチ、スラッシュを置くことでファイル名に一致するようにしてるんですが、Windows対応どうなってるんだろう。。","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #tech-emacs","ts":1614483325.075900,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01PA2W76TV/p1614483325075900","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01PA2W76TV/p1614483325075900"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6tR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63be762f-c155-491d-ad01-045db668af75","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ML done: \u003chttps://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/emacs-devel/2021-03/msg00032.html\u003e","ts":"1614651550.079600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qqe1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0bd188e9-5228-4a5d-bdb8-82f110fe23d7","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"最終的にビット演算になるらしい。\nうーん。良く分からないけどとりあえず投げてみますっ ()\n```# define CONSP(x) lisp_h_CONSP (x)\n#define lisp_h_CONSP(x) TAGGEDP (x, Lisp_Cons)\n# define TAGGEDP(a, tag) lisp_h_TAGGEDP (a, tag)\n#define lisp_h_TAGGEDP(a, tag) \\\n   (! (((unsigned) (XLI (a) \u0026gt;\u0026gt; (USE_LSB_TAG ? 0 : VALBITS)) \\\n\t- (unsigned) (tag)) \\\n       \u0026amp; ((1 \u0026lt;\u0026lt; GCTYPEBITS) - 1)))```","ts":"1614650121.079300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+eXw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cc1f2d77-6e3d-45e6-b0a2-c04a38538a9f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"CONSPの計算重さについては要検討","ts":"1614649884.078900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gVwm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58f659ab-c075-4d98-9521-b3b428bddcad","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"CONSPの方を消しても影響なかったので、たぶん死に条件。\nショートサーキットでnvarsの方しか通ってなかったものと思われる。\nでもLisperとしてはCONSPだけの方がちょっとかっこいい感がある。","ts":"1614649879.078700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NMM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"acf9ce13-6511-4ddd-89e9-65299abe4e7f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"パッチを生成した。\n\u003chttps://github.com/emacs-mirror/emacs/compare/master...conao3:refine-let\u003e","ts":"1614649738.078400","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: emacs-mirror/emacs","id":1,"title":"emacs-mirror/emacs","title_link":"https://github.com/emacs-mirror/emacs/compare/master...conao3:refine-let","text":"Mirror of GNU Emacs. Contribute to emacs-mirror/emacs development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8382104?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":420,"thumb_height":420,"from_url":"https://github.com/emacs-mirror/emacs/compare/master...conao3:refine-let","original_url":"https://github.com/emacs-mirror/emacs/compare/master...conao3:refine-let"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":3,"users":["U78A6ESHM","UFHQ7TNT0","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kmgb3"}]}]
